# Remaining work

State at this revision: 74 tools, 49 bundled skills, 712 tests, `./gradlew build`
green (validate + test + reobf + deploy).

## Open items (none blocking)

- **Persistence failures still report success.** `MemoryStore`, `LessonStore` and
  `SkillLibrary` log a warning when the atomic write fails (disk full, read-only
  directory, Windows file lock) but the tool envelope still says saved. Return a
  `*_not_persisted` error so the model can retry instead of trusting memory.
- **`SessionOutcome.fromReply` is a substring heuristic.** Markers such as
  `missing` and `failed` also occur in successful answers ("nothing is missing").
  Prefer an explicit outcome signal from the model, or match whole sentences.
- **`MachineRecipeService.loadAllRecipes` caches without synchronization.** Two
  agent threads can duplicate the read; the result is correct, the work is not.
- **`SessionIndex` grows forever.** `index.jsonl` keeps one line per run with no
  rotation; cap it once a server has thousands of sessions.
- **`.gitignore` still excludes `docs/evidence/*.log`,** but the `docs/` tree was
  removed in the refactor. Either restore the docs or drop the stale rules.

## Done recently

- UTF-8 (not platform charset) for every persisted harness file.
- Unique temp file per atomic write, so two live stores cannot splice a file.
- Learned skill directories are the authoritative key; `skills-disabled/` is now
  implemented (`/drone skills disable|enable|disabled`, `skill` tool actions).
- Session `world_actions` is actually counted and rendered.
- Logger: off-thread chat mirror, clear-vs-flush race, rotation without data loss.
- Config: atomic save, NaN temperature, null/empty saved-drone bindings.
- Hardcode guard: size/height variables are no longer rejected as coordinates.
- Auto-save only runs for successful tasks and a failed `skill_refine` no longer
  suppresses it.
